          "num": "Q.1",
          "instruction": "Read the passage and answer the questions. Write True or False for the true-false questions.",
          "stimulus": {
            "kind": "passage",
            "text": "On Saturday, the rain stopped after breakfast. Tanvi’s family went for a picnic in the park. Her mother packed hot puris, one boiled egg for each child and a bottle of nimbu pani. Her father carried a mat and a big umbrella. The path was wet, and small puddles shone in the sun. Tanvi’s cousin Jai jumped over every puddle. The park smelt of wet earth and fresh grass. Under a tall neem tree, they spread the mat. Suddenly, dark clouds came back, and big drops began to fall. “Quick!” said Father, and he opened the umbrella. Tanvi, her mother, her father and Jai sat close together under it and ate their puris. A green parrot sat on a branch and watched them. After half an hour, the sky cleared. A rainbow rose over the park. Jai clapped and shouted, “Look at that!” Tanvi said it was the best picnic ever.",
            "original": true
          },
